# BORGHERTZS_SORCEROUS_HANDS (jeuno 47): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job BLM, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 BLM: MonasticCavern's Treasure Coffer opens to WizardsCoat
# (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +128 (bit 7); TheEldiemeNecropolis's to WizardsTonban:
# +256 (bit 8).
lists MonasticCavern/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade TheEldiemeNecropolis/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=MonasticCavern pos=107.5,-3,-144 job=BLM lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsSorcerousHands accepted
item DavoiCofferKey
item EldiemeCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer DavoiCofferKey x1 # bit 7 unset: WizardsCoat; [AF]ZilartCoffer 128
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 301.5,-0.25,19.99 TheEldiemeNecropolis
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer EldiemeCofferKey x1 # bit 8 unset: WizardsTonban; [AF]ZilartCoffer 384
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
